.SH NAME
QApplication \- Manages the GUI application's control flow and main settings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qapplication.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QObject.
.PP
Inherited by QXtApplication.
.PP
